        "valueString": "Reports approximately 3–4 months of increased tiredness, most days, feeling more wiped out than usual and often needing to lie down after work. Worse after late or long shifts, especially night shifts. Still working full time; gym frequency has decreased from 4 times weekly to 1–2 times weekly."
